#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulink-Simulation.rst:5
#: 3114cb2aa008417d88ea74d556b3d3ad
msgid "Simulink Simulation"
msgstr "Simulink 仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulink-Simulation.rst:10
#: ec9a92e3e0b74ae7ba6059067ee9854a
msgid ""
"`Connection blocks "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/AP_Conector.slx>`__"
" are provided to read and write to ArduPilot SITL, along with examples for a"
" `basic rover "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Rover>`__"
" and a `complex helicopter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Heli>`__"
" model. Both examples require additional MATLAB toolboxes. It is recommended"
" to run the :ref:`MATLAB example <MATLAB-Simulation>` to test the connection"
" before proceeding to the Simulink examples, the Simulink connection is made"
" using the same ``-f JSON:127.0.0.1`` command."
msgstr ""
"系统提供了用于读写 ArduPilot SITL 的 `连接模块 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/AP_Conector.slx>`__，以及"
" `基础漫游车 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Rover>`__"
" 和 `复杂直升机 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Heli>`__"
" 模型的示例。两个示例均需要额外的 MATLAB 工具箱。建议在进行 Simulink 示例之前，先运行 :ref:`MATLAB 示例 "
"<MATLAB-Simulation>` 来测试连接，Simulink 连接使用相同的 ``-f JSON:127.0.0.1`` 命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulink-Simulation.rst:16
#: 03070d592ce045adbff766aff3eb7d1c
msgid ""
"The Simulink connection library and examples were made using 2020a, older "
"versions of the software can't use these files. Someone with access to 2020a"
" can export for use with a older version, however it may not run as "
"expected. Join the Discord simulation channel for help."
msgstr ""
"Simulink 连接库和示例使用 2020a 版本制作，旧版本软件无法使用这些文件。有权限使用 2020a "
"的用户可以导出供旧版本使用，但可能无法按预期运行。请加入 Discord 仿真频道获取帮助。"
